OL,4,CHospital admin roles threatened in     
OL,5,C#90m cuts plan                         
OL,6,GAn NHS hospital trust is reviewing     
OL,7,Gadministrative and clerical roles as   
OL,8,Git looks to cut #90m in costs.         
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals Tees, which       
OL,11,Fcovers North and South Tees NHS        
OL,12,FFoundation Trusts, previously          
OL,13,Fannounced it is preparing to cut up to 
OL,14,F550 roles.                             
OL,16,FIts chief delivery officer Russell     
OL,17,FNightingale said any proposed changes  
OL,18,Fwill be "subject to formal             
OL,19,Fconsultation with affected staff and   
OL,20,Ftrade union representatives" and would 
OL,21,F"primarily" come through not filling   
OL,22,Fvacancies and voluntary measures. G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
