OL,4,CTown's 'ambitious' future becomes a    
OL,5,Cvideo game                             
OL,6,GA town centre has been turned into a   
OL,7,Gvideo game to allow residents to       
OL,8,Gexplore how the area could look after  
OL,9,Gits redevelopment.                     
OL,11,FA virtual reality version of Gateshead 
OL,12,Fhas been created by VR planning firm   
OL,13,FDigital Urban, which will allow users  
OL,14,Fto "walk" or "run" through the town.   
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
